<title>BULGARIA: SOCCER-BULGARIA 4 CYPRUS 1 WORLD CUP QUALIFIER - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BULGARIA 4 CYPRUS 1 WORLD CUP QUALIFIER - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria beat Cyprus 4-1 (halftime</p>
<p>2-0) in their World Cup European group five qualifier on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Bulgaria - Daniel Borimirov 2, Emil Kostadinov 36, 45,</p>
<p>Ivailo Yordanov 66</p>
<p>Cyprus - Ioannios Okkas 61</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,000</p>
<p>Teams:</p>
<p>Bulgaria - 1-Zdravko Zdravkov; 2-Radostin Kishishev,</p>
<p>3-Trifon Ivanov, 4-Gosho Ginchev, 5-Ivailo Yordanov, 6-Zlatko</p>
<p>Yankov (19-Dobromir Mitov 80), 7-Emil Kostadinov, 8-Daniel</p>
<p>Borimirov (14-Anatoli Nankov 58), 9-Georgi Donkov (18-Kostadin</p>
<p>Videlov 73), 10-Krasimir Balakov, 11-Ilian Iliev</p>
<p>Cyprus - 1-Andreas Petrides; 2-Georgios Theodotou, 3-</p>
<p>Charalambos Pittas (Vasilios Melanarkitis 77), 4-Sozos Yiannaki,</p>
<p>5-Angelos Misos, 6- Neophytos Larcou, 7-Nicodemos Papavassiliou,</p>
<p>8-Panayiotis Engomitis, 9-Klimis Alexandrou (4-Ioannis Okkas</p>
<p>46), 10-Marios Charalambous, 11-Nikolaos Timotheou (16-Loukas</p>
<p>Hadjiloukas 73)</p>
<p>    Standings  Pl  W   D   L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> Israel	  5   3   1   1   7   4    10</p>
<p> Bulgaria	4   3   0   1  10   5     9</p>
<p> Russia	  4   2   2   0  10   2     8</p>
<p> Cyprus	  5   1   1   3   5  12     4</p>
<p> Luxembourg    4   0   0   4   1  10     0</p>
<p>Next matches: April 30 Israel v Cyprus, Russia v Luxembourg</p>
</text>
